{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17566","headline":"奉陪段相公晚夏登张仪楼 · 温会","name":"奉陪段相公晚夏登张仪楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危轩重叠开，访古上裴回。\n有舌嗟秦策，飞梁驾楚材。\n云霄随凤到，物象爲诗来。\n欲和关山意，巴歌调更哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温会","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}